  "items": [
    {
      "_id": "MQW5ji6jQpkKYHBW",
      "name": "Broker",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/tools/hand/scale-balances-merchant-brown.webp",
      "system": {
        "category": "calling",
        "identifier": "calling-broker",
        "source": "Callings",
        "tags": [
          "calling",
          "broker",
          "presence"
        ],
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>\"There is no problem two reasonable parties can't monetize.\"</em></p><p><strong>Broker</strong> is the Presence Calling — the trade that kept its bearers alive after the Shattering. Umbrella: merchant, envoy, entertainer, cult recruiter, gang face. A profession is a flavor label on the Calling.</p><p><strong>Knack — Fair Price:</strong> The Broker moves any negotiated price <strong>5% per tier</strong> in their side's favor inside the ±25% tolerance band (Tier IV: the full ±20% swing).</p><p><strong>Aptitude kit:</strong> signature aptitude <strong>Diplomacy</strong> rank = tier; secondary <strong>Empathy</strong> rank = tier − 1.</p><p><strong>Services:</strong> a standard job costs the tier fee (T1 10 / T2 30 / T3 90 / T4 270 marks), paid in <strong>Diplomacy or Soft Power (GM picks by job)</strong> marks. Cross-pool ×1.5 friction applies as usual.</p><p><strong>Tiers:</strong> Apprentice → Initiate → Master → Archon. Grant the matching tier features alongside this class item.</p><p><strong>Awakens into:</strong> Harmony Marshal. A Steward is a Calling that ignited into a Path — Surge is the mark of Stewardship, which is why no Calling banks or spends it.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
      },
